    "title": "Police discover crack cocaine at Easton home, make arrest - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jacob Kise ,\n2 hours ago EASTON, Pa. - A man is facing charges after police say they recovered crack cocaine at an Easton home. Sharod Robinson is facing charges of possession with intent to deliver a controlled substance (crack cocaine), tampering with physical evidence, and possession of drug paraphernalia, according to a news release from the Easton Police Department. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
